{{define "pricing"}}
<h1>Pricing</h1>
{{if not .Available}}<div class="note"><strong>Cloud only.</strong> This control plane runs a self-hosted (SQLite) backend, which charges no one — there is no price list to manage here. Pricing and regions are a managed-cloud (Postgres) subsystem.</div>{{else}}
{{if .Flash}}<div class="flash-ok">{{.Flash}}</div>{{end}}
{{if .FlashErr}}<div class="flash-err">{{.FlashErr}}</div>{{end}}

<p class="note">
  <strong>We bill for what we operate.</strong> The core lines are <strong>relay</strong>
  (bandwidth, above a free allowance — priced per region on the Regions page),
  <strong>compute</strong> (managed boxes, per class/region) and <strong>storage</strong>
  (bytes we hold). The account itself is free (email or OAuth), and mail is
  <em>bring-your-own</em> (connect your Gmail/Outlook/IMAP) and never billed —
  not the anchor (BOX-MODEL-02). Self-host the apps for $0.
  <br><br>
  Prices are canonical in <strong>USD</strong>. Customers are <strong>charged in ZAR</strong> —
  Paystack settles in rands — so the ZAR column is what actually lands on the card, at the
  current exchange rate. A price of 0 is only ever legitimate for Free and for custom-quoted
  Enterprise; anywhere else it would be a product we give away.
</p>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr>
  <th>SKU</th><th>Name</th><th>Unit</th><th>USD</th><th>ZAR (charged)</th>
  <th>Status</th><th>Last change</th><th>New price</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Prices}}
<tr>
  <td><code>{{.SKU}}</code></td>
  <td>{{.Name}}</td>
  <td>{{.Unit}}</td>
  <td>${{.USD}}</td>
  <td>{{if .Custom}}<span class="ro">quoted</span>{{else}}R{{.ZAR}}{{end}}</td>
  <td>
    {{if .Custom}}<span class="ro">custom-quoted</span>
    {{else if .Active}}<span class="ok">active</span>
    {{else}}<span class="warn">withdrawn</span>{{end}}
  </td>
  <td>{{if .UpdatedBy}}{{.UpdatedBy}}<br><span class="ro">{{.UpdatedAt}}</span>{{else}}<span class="ro">seeded</span>{{end}}</td>
  <td>
    {{if .Custom}}
      <span class="ro">not self-servable</span>
    {{else}}
    <form method="POST" action="/superadmin/pricing" class="inline-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{$.CSRFToken}}">
      <input type="hidden" name="sku" value="{{.SKU}}">
      <input type="text" name="usd" value="{{.USD}}" size="7" required>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="active" value="1" {{if .Active}}checked{{end}}> active</label>
      <button type="submit" class="primary">Save</button>
    </form>
    {{end}}
  </td>
</tr>
{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{end}}{{/* Available */}}
{{end}}
